                    Parameters for BIVPLT
                    *********************
 
START OF PARAMETERS:
well_seis.dat             \file with data
4   9   0                 \columns for x variable, y variable, and wt
histsmth_poro.out         \file with smoothed X distribution
histsmth_Lf.out           \file with smoothed Y distribution
scatsmth.out              \file with smoothed bivariate distribution
bivplt.ps                 \file for PostScript output
0                         \number of contours (0 -> none)
1   1                     \pixel map? (0=no, 1=yes), (0=B&W, 1=color)
30                        \number of histogram classes (marginals)
Caroline's Example Data   \Title
